# HTTP API discipline

Validate and sanitize external input at boundaries. Return appropriate
HTTP status codes; do not leak stack traces in JSON errors.

Use consistent pagination and error envelope shapes already in the repo.
Version breaking changes explicitly; prefer additive fields in JSON.
